Statement of changes (Apache License 2.0, section 4(b))
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

sxm-player is NOT redistributed in this repository. It is cloned at build time
and the checkout is gitignored, so the upstream source is not vendored here.

What this repository does carry is a patch that modifies upstream source at
image build time, plus new files compiled alongside it. The patch is
`extras/patches/samo-stability.patch` and it is applied against upstream commit
`470b35b`. Modified upstream files:

  SXMPlayer.Client/SiriusXMPlayer.cs
  SXMPlayer.Client/Services/IcecastStreamer.cs
  SXMPlayer.Client/Services/Icecast/HlsSegmentProducer.cs
  SXMPlayer.Client/Services/Icecast/SegmentFanoutHub.cs
  SXMPlayer.Client/Services/Icecast/IcyStreamWriter.cs

The changes give listeners per-connection identity rather than per-IP, keep the
shared HLS producer alive briefly after its last subscriber leaves, rate-limit
channel changes, start playback further back in the playlist window, replay a
short backlog to newly connected clients, and pace response output to real time.
`extras/patches/README.md` explains each in full.

New files added by this repository, not derived from upstream:

  extras/SamoExtras.cs          — /channels and /ui routes
  extras/DecorationsGenre.cs    — extends a generated partial record
  extras/StreamPacer.cs         — real-time output pacing
  extras/SamoStabilityTests.cs  — tests for the above

